               <exData contentType="text/html">
                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">INSTRUCTIONS<span style="font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none">: Federal law requires a parent loan recipient to be either a United States citizen or an eligible non-citizen. See definition of a parent below.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>In order to verify eligibility for a PLUS loan, complete this form and attach photocopies of the front and back side of your documentation of the item checked below.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none">Incomplete documents will not be returned. They will be disposed of in a secure manner, per university policy. This will delay processing.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></span></p></body>
